# React UI

## Shells vs screens

- `popup/` and `options/` stay thin: HTML, `main.tsx`, app router/shell
- Full screens live in `src/components/screens/`
- Shared primitives go in `src/components/ui/` when extracted

```ts
// ❌ BAD — screen file inside popup/
// src/popup/WelcomeScreen.tsx

// ✅ GOOD
import { WelcomeScreen } from '@/components/screens/WelcomeScreen';
```

## Styling

- Use existing Tailwind theme tokens (`md-bg`, `md-accent`, `p-pad`, …) from `src/styles`
- Prefer functional components; extract hooks to `src/hooks` when reusable across screens
- Popup UIs should fit the fixed popup height without unnecessary scroll when designed that way
